export const actionLabels={tag:'Tag nearby player',none:'Do nothing',jump:'Jump',slide:'Slide',left:'Move left',right:'Move right',switchlane:'Switch lane',addvariable:'Add to a counter',setvariable:'Set a counter',restart:'Restart game'};
export const variableLabel=name=>({Score:'Coins / score',Health:'Health',Jumps:'Jumps made',JumpHeight:'Jump strength',Lane:'Current lane',Distance:'Distance travelled'})[name]||name;
export function editorActionReason(action,{playing=false,selected=true,undo=1,redo=1}={}){if(action==='undo')return playing?'Stop the test to undo changes.':!undo?'No changes to undo.':'';if(action==='redo')return playing?'Stop the test to redo changes.':!redo?'No changes to redo.':'';if(['duplicate','delete','sprite','animation','attach','face-pointer','movement','behavior','link-platform'].includes(action)&&!selected)return 'Select an object first.';if(playing&&['duplicate','delete','sprite','animation','attach','face-pointer','movement','behavior','link-platform','camera','appearance','looks','ui','game-ui','title','presentation','physics','size','inputs','add-event','new-variable'].includes(action))return 'Stop the test before changing your game.';return ''}
